<title>INDIA: India Nagarjuna falls on lower net news.</title>
<headline>India Nagarjuna falls on lower net news.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of Nagarjuna Fertilisers and Chemicals Ltd. shed 1.25 rupees, or 7.5 percent, to 15.25 rupees on Thursday after the company announced lower profits for 1996/97, traders said.</p>
